== Quick Access Tips ==

'''Complete [[Hate, Betrayal, and Trust]] to gain free access to the castle.''' See the quest page for the full walkthrough and dialogue.

<div class="checkbox-list" id="nektropos-castle-entry-checklist">
* Travel west from [[Nektulos Forest]] into [[Lake Nerius]] and speak to [[Retainer Ozval]] at the central huts, near (201, -97, -7).
* Loot the [[Ancient Signet Ring of House Everling]] from [[Corrupted Kedgespawn]] in the northwest lake at (2662, 1238, -119). Return the ring to Ozval. '''/pick''' or a private instance may be needed for the ring mob.
* Get the [[Peerless Sapphire]] from [[Merchant Tyslin (North Felwithe)|Merchant Tyslin]] in [[Felwithe|Northern Felwithe]], at (107, -438): '''"Ozval sent me"'''. Put it in your bags.
* Get the [[Exquisite Gem Setter]] from [[Rylin Coil]] in [[Ak'Anon]], at (1469, -190): '''"Ozval sent me"'''. Put it in your bags.
* Turn both merchant items in to [[Retainer Ozval]].
* Get the [[Blessing of the Betrayer]] from the [[High Priestess of Ulkorruuk]] on the second floor of [[Plane of Hate]], at (-90, 287, 127): hail and '''"swear"'''. Use the '''normal, non-instanced zone''', do not hide or sneak, and put the blessing in your bags.
* Deliver the blessing to [[Retainer Ozval]], then follow the path north and click the castle gates.
</div>

'''Once inside:''' Follow [[The Tragic Tale of House Everling]] for the [[Nektropos Library Key]], then [[The Betrayer#Castle Route and Door Keys|The Betrayer]] for the remaining door keys, basement route, and boss mechanics.

== Map ==

The castle consists of multiple floors, locked rooms, and a basement. Progression through its interior requires completing quests and obtaining keys to access restricted areas.

See [[The Tragic Tale of House Everling]] and [[The Betrayer]] for information on navigating the castle and unlocking its doors.

== Dangers ==

Nektropos Castle is a high-level dungeon inhabited by powerful undead, golems, and other dangerous creatures associated with the Everling household. Its numerous named enemies and locked passages make exploring the castle particularly hazardous.

Adventurers must also contend with encounters tied to the castle's main questline, which involves defeating bosses and progressing through restricted areas of the estate.

== Benefits ==

Nektropos Castle offers a wide variety of equipment dropped by its many named inhabitants, along with a quest reward obtained through its main storyline. The castle's quests also unlock access to restricted areas, allowing adventurers to explore deeper into the estate and confront its most dangerous inhabitants.

Throughout their exploration, adventurers can encounter members of the Everling family and uncover the events surrounding their tragic fate.

== Traveling To and From ==

Nektropos Castle is located beyond [[Lake Nerius]], which can be reached from [[Nektulos Forest]].

The castle gates are initially locked. To gain entry, adventurers must complete [[Hate, Betrayal, and Trust]], beginning with [[Retainer Ozval]] in Lake Nerius. This questline requires obtaining several items and traveling to the [[Plane of Hate]].

Once the entry requirements have been completed, adventurers can enter the castle through its main gates.

